OL,3,GNEWSATeenage girl admits murder in row
OL,4,Aover boy
OL,5,
OL,6,FDowling and Archie Rycroft, 20, who
OL,7,Ffollowed Smith to the fight at the
OL,8,Fhouse in Kennerleigh Avenue in Leeds,
OL,9,Fare also charged with murder and
OL,10,Fmanslaughter and their trial will
OL,11,Fcontinue.
